--- !u!114 &267328621
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 267328620}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4cb4989dd82c5241aefe252aa66fdfd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 812715020}
  textComponent: {fileID: 1893432719}
  nameComponent: {fileID: 179146603}
  sentences:
  - Do I just use this kiosk machine to report my lost wallet?
  - I mean it is not like asking the police for help would be useful anyways.
  - Do you need help with the machine?
  - Uh yea..
  - Which catergory does missing valueables fall under?
  - That will be under 'Filing Reports'.
  - Did you lose it somewhere closeby?
  - Somewhere around the neighbourhood.
  - But I am not too sure specifically where.
  - Well I am about to go on my patroling duty.
  - We can try to find your wallet while at it.
  - Oh are you sure?
  - Yes of course.
  - Oh okay. Thank you.
  names:
  - Benny
  - Benny
  - Police Officer
  - Benny
  - Benny
  - Police Officer
  - Police Officer
  - Benny
  - Benny
  - Police Officer
  - Police Officer
  - Benny
  - Police Officer
  - Benny
  textSpeed: 0.01
  unlockCursorDuringDialogue: 1
